{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"fortran","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Fortran","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Fortran (.f90 .f95 .f03 .f08).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"fortran","name":"Fortran","extensions":[".f90",".f95",".f03",".f08",".f",".for"],"grammar":"grammars/fortran.json","lineComment":"!"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Fortran","path":"snippets/fortran.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/fortran.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": true,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"!.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:allocatable|deallocate|subroutine|character|interface|parameter|recursive|allocate|contains|function|implicit|complex|integer|logical|pointer|private|program|common|elseif|intent|module|public|result|return|select|target|cycle|endif|enddo|inout|print|where|while|write|call|case|else|exit|kind|none|only|read|real|save|stop|then|type|end|out|use|do|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:\\\\.false\\\\.|\\\\.true\\\\.)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:allocated|maxval|minval|matmul|sqrt|size|trim|abs|sin|cos|exp|log|len|sum)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/fortran.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Program\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prog\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"program ${1:main}\",\n      \"\\timplicit none\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end program ${1:main}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A program\"\n  },\n  \"Subroutine\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sub\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"subroutine ${1:name}(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\timplicit none\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end subroutine ${1:name}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A subroutine\"\n  },\n  \"Do loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"do\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"do ${1:i} = 1, ${2:n}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end do\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A do loop\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Fortran\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Fortran.\n\n## Files\n\n`.f90`, `.f95`, `.f03`, `.f08`, `.f`, `.for`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `!`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `prog` | A program |\n| `sub` | A subroutine |\n| `do` | A do loop |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}